# Thranduil, Sindarin Liege: "Other Elves you control get +1/+1" and "Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, create a 1/1
# green Elf creature token." On turn 1 Bot1 casts Thranduil (a 2/3, not pumped by himself), plays a Forest - the landfall makes an
# Elf token, a 2/2 - and casts a Llanowar Elves with it, also a 2/2. Bot2's Llanowar Elves, an opponent's, stays a 1/1.

